      },
      "message": "fix(xtask): test scanner ignores braces in strings, chars and comments\n\ntest_fns counted every brace, so refuse(\"{\", ..) swallowed the next test\nand `gate test <next>` found nothing. A small lexer now skips string, raw\nstring, char literal and // comment content. PROCESS_VERSION 10 -> 11.\n\nFixes #764\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
